@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff

StartWatch:! --> HourAdjustment: Start Adjusting Time
HourAdjustment: Adjust Hour: HourAdjustment: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*] --> AlarmHourAdjustment
AlarmHourAdjustment: Adjust Alarm Hour: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*] --> MinuteAdjustment
MinuteAdjustment: Adjust Minute: MinuteAdjustment: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*] --> AlarmOff
AlarmOff: Turn Off Alarm: AlarmOff
LightOn[*] --> LightOn
LightOn[*] --> LightOff
LightOff: Turn Off Light: LightOff

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online College Magazine System

state LoginChoice
state AdminProfileManagement
state ArticleReview
state ContentCreation
state Editing
state AccessDenied
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticle
state FeedbackProvided

LoginChoice:! --> AdminProfileManagement: Login as Admin
AdminProfileManagement: Logout: LoginChoice
ContentCreation: AdminProfileManagement: Create/Edit User Profile: AdminProfileManagement
ArticleReview: AdminProfileManagement: Review Articles: AdminProfileManagement
Editing: ArticleReview: Edit Articles: AdminProfileManagement
AccessDenied: LoginChoice: Access Denied
PublishedArticles: ArticleReview: Publish Articles: AdminProfileManagement
SearchArticle: PublishedArticles: Search for More Articles: PublishedArticles
FeedbackProvided: SearchArticle: Provide Feedback: SearchArticle

title UML State Machine Diagram - Smart Traffic Management System

state TrafficMonitoring
state StreetLightControl
state TrafficSignalManagement
state VehicleNumberCapture
state RuleVerification
state NoViolation
state ViolationRecorded
state FinePaid
state WarningSent

TrafficMonitoring:! --> StreetLightControl: Start Monitoring
StreetLightControl: Stop Monitoring: TrafficMonitoring
TrafficSignalManagement: TrafficMonitoring: Manage Signals: TrafficMonitoring
VehicleNumberCapture: TrafficSignalManagement: Capture Vehicle Numbers: TrafficSignalManagement
RuleVerification: VehicleNumberCapture: Verify Rules: VehicleNumberCapture
NoViolation: RuleVerification: No Violation: RuleVerification
ViolationRecorded: RuleVerification: Record Violation: RuleVerification
FinePaid: ViolationRecorded: Fine Paid: ViolationRecorded
WarningSent: ViolationRecorded: Warning Sent: ViolationRecorded

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online Marketplace

state Registration
state Verification
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state ProductExploration
state ProductViewing
state PurchaseDecision
state Logout

Registration:! --> Verification: Start Verification
Verification: Logout: Registration
SellerWorkspace[*]: Verification: Access Workspace: SellerWorkspace
ProductAddition: SellerWorkspace: Add New Products: SellerWorkspace
ProductPromotion: SellerWorkspace: Promote Existing Products: SellerWorkspace
CustomerDashboard[*]: Verification: Access Dashboard: CustomerDashboard
ProductExploration: CustomerDashboard: Explore Products: CustomerDashboard
ProductViewing: ProductExploration: View Available Products: ProductExploration
PurchaseDecision: ProductViewing: Proceed with Purchase or Stop Browsing: ProductViewing
Logout: SellerWorkspace: Log Out: SellerWorkspace

@enduml
